    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that requests speaker diarization for a recorded meeting using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task, as it is a well-known service for speech recognition and diarization. The script will import the necessary Google Cloud client library, authenticate using the environment variable for the service account key, and call the diarization endpoint. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789854972484,
          "start": 1789854969050
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbab6cda001yn3Vsob76DTcOO",
